    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Arachnophobia",
      "category": "defensive",
      "text": "The first time in a round that a creature utilizes any spider-themed action in Irrokcis's presence (such as casting illusory creature to create a spider, or using summon animal to summon spiders), the lich becomes Slowed 1 for 1 round from his horror. As long as a spider is visible to him (including a work of art, such as the Horrid Figurine from area F14), he takes a –1 status penalty to saves against fear effects and loses steady spellcasting. The horrid figurine from area F14 is particularly effective if used against Irrokcis—increase that item's save DCs to 32 when they're used against the lich."
    },
